    "_metadata": {
     "name": "Andrei Svechnikov",
     "description": "In Game 5 of the Stanley Cup Final, Andrei Svechnikov delivered a huge two-goal performance that helped tilt the series decisively in the Carolina Hurricanes\u2019 favor. \r\nHis third period tally, his second of the game, was a thing of beauty on the power play, as he received a gorgeous spinning pass and deftly tapped the puck into the net at the post to extend the lead to 4-1 and put the game out of reach. \r\nSvechnikov\u2019s two goals proved instrumental in the 4-2 victory that gave Carolina a 3-2 series lead and propelled the Hurricanes toward their 2026 Stanley Cup championship.\n\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
